- Not at all.


00:09:16.349 --> 00:09:17.975
- Has Pepe arrived?
- No, not yet.


00:09:18.059 --> 00:09:18.893
Hi, Eva.


00:09:18.976 --> 00:09:20.269
What's this?


00:09:20.353 --> 00:09:21.687
